  "version": "0.17.0-alpha.9",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.9 - 2026-07-01\n\n### Features\n\n- Make automatic history cleanup follow the Storage settings, including a new Unlimited option for maximum history items (#1225)\n- Add an About & Maintainers link from the app's About settings so users can see who maintains the project (#1228)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep favorited items from being removed by automatic cleanup when that protection is enabled (#1225)\n- Fix copied image files so their file names, sizes, and image previews display correctly right away (#1217)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.9 - 2026-07-01\n\n### Features\n\n- 自动清理历史记录现在会遵循存储设置，并为最大历史条数新增“无限制”选项 (#1225)\n- 在应用的“关于”设置中新增“关于与维护者”入口，方便用户查看项目维护者信息 (#1228)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 开启收藏保护时，自动清理不再移除已收藏的记录 (#1225)\n- 修复复制图片文件后文件名、大小和图片预览不能立即正确显示的问题 (#1217)",
